abstract: >-
  A local-first, open-source neuro-symbolic architecture pairing a stateless LLM
  front-end (<= 2,200-token working-memory packets) with an ACID SQLite epistemic
  ledger enforcing engine-level verifier-scope coupling (trg_verif_scope_coupling),
  single-claim atomicity, and defeasible negative provenance ([FALSIFIED] -> reopens).
  Includes Volume I (Two Hands in a Local Box, 56 pp.), Volume II (The Age of Overkill
  and the Grounded Wire, 26 pp.), Failures, Parables & Crash Reports (13 pp.), the
  adversarial Trilogy Redline Vetting Report, schema/schema.sql, the 11-test invariant
  suite, and the Kestrel-7 20-step stateful gauntlet.
